	no double insert, no leak; --undefined-shift-check.  VERIFIED;
	mutant_prefix/ (before the /0 mask fix) is VIOLATED on the shift
	by 32, mutant/ (the inet_prefix > 32 check removed) on the shift
	and the mask.  CBMC evaluates the undefined shift as 0, the right
	/0 mask by accident; amd64 gives all ones.  pf_init_threshold has
	no body (its fields are not checked).  Native: CLEAN.

