netinet/icmp_input
	icmp_input_if() of sys/netinet/ip_icmp.c on a 20 byte IP header and
	8..56 ICMP bytes of arbitrary content in one or two mbufs, ip_len as
	ipv4_check leaves it, the sysctls arbitrary.  The real length
	checks, pullup, type switch, error types, ECHO, TSTAMP, MASKREQ and
