netinet/tcp_dooptions
	tcp_dooptions() of sys/netinet/tcp_input.c on an options area of
	0..28 bytes (real maximum 40) directly behind the header and an
	arbitrary connection state; TCP_SIGNATURE and INET6 defined.  The
