netinet/tcp_sack_option
	tcp_sack_option() of sys/netinet/tcp_input.c, the SACK half of the
	split with netinet/tcp_dooptions (its contract assumed here), after
	tcp_del_sackholes() as tcp_input_solocked calls them; an option of
