	out at 1500 s.  EMPTY_HEAD_OK 0 is VIOLATED (FINDINGS).  Not
	covered: the TCP_SACKHOLE_LIMIT exits, t_maxseg other than 512,
	dups.  Mutants VIOLATED: snd_numholes-- removed, the trim test
